<title>UK: LME registers new copper and tin brands.</title>
<headline>LME registers new copper and tin brands.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London Metal Exchange (LME) said on Tuesday that it registered new brands of Chilean copper and Indonesian tin for delivery against its contracts.</p>
<p>At a Board meeting on Monday, the LME approved Codelco's 'AE-SX-EW' copper and P.T. Koba's 'KOBA' tin brands with immediate affect.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom 44 171 542 8080</p>
</text>
